00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,840
is quite interesting,

282
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,799
or why would you

283
00:12:35,799 --> 00:12:36,559
know me so well?

284
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,600
Not at all.

285
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:39,679
I don't know you.

286
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:42,159
But I know trophy wives well.

287
00:12:42,559 --> 00:12:43,519
My sister is one.

288
00:12:43,879 --> 00:12:45,679
Usually she doesn't come to the office.

289
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,200
But when she shows up,

290
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:48,200
people have to praise her

291
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,440
for being amazing and capable.

292
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,352
What a tough life, Mr. Di.

293
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:56,960
But you can't take a part for the whole.

294
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,399
You can't assume everyone else

295
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,600
is like your sister.

296
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,399
Miss Weng,

297
00:13:00,519 --> 00:13:01,600
you should

298
00:13:01,759 --> 00:13:03,600
broaden your perspective.

299
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:07,399
Mr. Han,

300
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,080
my wife Meng

301
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,279
plays tennis really well.

302
00:13:10,799 --> 00:13:12,240
She taught me how to play.

303
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:14,080
Perfect, let's play a match.

304
00:13:14,519 --> 00:13:15,759
If you win,

305
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,799
for the new contract,

306
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:19,120
I'll give another
0.5 percent concession.

307
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,240
If you lose,

308
00:13:20,519 --> 00:13:22,639
you give me another 0.5 percent.

309
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:23,600
Deal?

310
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,679
Since Mr. Han proposed it,

311
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,639
how about

312
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,039
we round it up?

313
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:31,000
One percent.

314
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:31,919
How's it?

315
00:13:32,039 --> 00:13:32,639
Deal.

316
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,080
Check please.

317
00:13:39,399 --> 00:13:40,200
Court three.

318
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:40,960
Booked by Mr. Di.

319
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,240
Okay, just a moment.

320
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,080
Will Mr. Han back out

321
00:13:44,159 --> 00:13:45,639
on the concession he promised?

322
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:47,480
Don't take it seriously.

323
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:48,759
He was just saying that.

324
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,759
Then why did you go all out just now?

325
00:13:51,799 --> 00:13:52,759
Han Guang didn't budge.

326
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,120
The contract isn't finalized.

327
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:54,879
How did he know

328
00:13:54,919 --> 00:13:55,960
how much one percent is?

329
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,879
He didn't want to make the concession,

330
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,919
but wanted me to see

331
00:13:59,000 --> 00:13:59,960
that in the partnership

332
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,039
between Jiali and him,

333
00:14:01,039 --> 00:14:02,039
he holds the upper hand.

334
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:02,879
That's all.

335
00:14:03,039 --> 00:14:04,480
You are so sharp

336
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,080
when it comes to business,

337
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,600
but about Di Liren,

338
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,159
why do you believe everything?

339
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,919
You saw it.

340
00:14:13,279 --> 00:14:14,639
Liren and that Chen Chen

341
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:15,639
have nothing going on.

342
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,480
He was just covering for Han Guang.

343
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,559
Please scan here to pay.

344
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:20,360
Right.

345
00:14:20,559 --> 00:14:22,320
Should I give Mr. Di's
new membership gift

346
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,919
to you now,

347
00:14:24,039 --> 00:14:25,360
or to Mr. Di

348
00:14:25,399 --> 00:14:26,799
next time?

349
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,120
New membership?

350
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,000
(How long have you been
practicing here?)

351
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:33,559
(All told,)

352
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:34,720
(it's been five months.)

353
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:43,039
What's wrong?

354
00:14:46,679 --> 00:14:47,480
Weng Yue?

355
00:14:48,799 --> 00:14:50,519
No wonder she's so hostile towards you.

356
00:14:50,919 --> 00:14:51,840
Case solved.

357
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,720
(You always say you're lucky.)

358
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,559
(My luck isn't as good as yours.)

359
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:06,799
I haven't met

360
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:08,639
someone outstanding like Mr. Di.

361
00:15:08,639 --> 00:15:09,960
(But he works too hard.)

362
00:15:10,559 --> 00:15:11,440
(If it were me,)

363
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,360
(I could've helped him more.)

364
00:15:29,888 --> 00:15:31,104
(Weng Yue)

365
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,064
(Yaoyan Daily Chemicals, Weng Yue)

366
00:15:32,544 --> 00:15:33,152
(Mr. Di, available this afternoon?
Let's discuss future collaboration.)

367
00:15:33,152 --> 00:15:33,728
(Time and place.)

368
00:15:36,896 --> 00:15:37,408
(Run because I don't want to run.)

369
00:15:45,472 --> 00:15:46,656
(This workout improves aerobic capacity,
high intensity)

370
00:16:00,519 --> 00:16:02,120
Honey, what are you looking at?

371
00:16:02,919 --> 00:16:04,159
Stop it.

372
00:16:04,919 --> 00:16:06,080
Honey.

373
00:16:07,279 --> 00:16:07,960
You have a call.

374
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,000
Hello?

375
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:14,840
Go ahead.

376
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:20,799
There are comments online

377
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,120
questioning your body fat rate.

378
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:23,279
I'll take a picture

379
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,480
and show them all.

380
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,240
Okay, no problem.

381
00:16:30,336 --> 00:16:32,288
(New semester, new journey)

382
00:16:33,679 --> 00:16:34,519
You suspect

383
00:16:34,759 --> 00:16:35,600
your husband

384
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,440
started morning jogs

385
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,480
because of Weng Yue?

386
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:41,000
I'm not suspecting my husband.

387
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,559
I'm worried that another woman

388
00:16:42,639 --> 00:16:43,320
is eyeing him.

389
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:44,399
What's the difference?

390
00:16:44,679 --> 00:16:45,960
Of course there's a difference.

391
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,159
Right.

392
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,440
I got the workout data

393
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,960
from his phone and his watch.

394
00:16:51,519 --> 00:16:52,399
Take a look for me.

395
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,240
Mom!

396
00:16:55,159 --> 00:16:55,759
Liu Bai,

397
00:16:55,879 --> 00:16:56,360
my brother.

398
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,320
You should go to him.

399
00:16:57,519 --> 00:16:58,399
He studied psychology,

400
00:16:58,399 --> 00:17:00,480
a fan of detective novels
and crime shows.

401
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:02,279
He had been unemployed for three years.

402
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:03,279
He just came recently

403
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,240
to live with me.

404
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,000
Feel free to bother him. Don't be shy.

405
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:08,720
Hello, Meng.

406
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:10,319
Bai.

407
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:11,000
Ms. Meng.

408
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:11,720
Mom.

409
00:17:12,079 --> 00:17:13,519
They're always playing tennis

410
00:17:13,519 --> 00:17:14,480
together.

411
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,200
As emotions rise,

412
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,400
they might touch each other.

413
00:17:17,519 --> 00:17:18,599
What if Weng Yue

414
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:19,240
can't resist

415
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,279
my husband's charm,

416
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:22,240
and wants to be the mistress?

417
00:17:22,759 --> 00:17:24,400
Let's call her "Missy".

418
00:17:26,079 --> 00:17:26,920
If Weng Yue

419
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:28,359
is the one who gave you the photos,

420
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,759
she's either already a "Missy",

421
00:17:29,759 --> 00:17:31,240
or on her way to becoming one.

422
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:39,200
(Honey, I have
a lot of work to do today.)

423
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:40,519
(I won't be home till late.)

424
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:42,039
(Can't have dinner with you.)

425
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,616
(Let Liu Zi eat with you.)

426
00:17:44,079 --> 00:17:45,160
(Weng Yue's moments)
I'm all ready.

427
00:17:45,519 --> 00:17:46,720
We'll meet later.

428
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:49,279
I'm feeling excited and nervous.

429
00:17:52,359 --> 00:17:52,839
Shall we go?

430
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:54,680
Yes.

431
00:17:58,319 --> 00:17:59,359
Where are you going?

432
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,519
For something big.

433
00:18:06,279 --> 00:18:07,480
The scent of this lip gloss

434
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:09,160
is way too strong.

435
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,839
Besides citrus notes, there are also

436
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:13,279
weird smells like

437
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:14,839
vanilla,

438
00:18:15,759 --> 00:18:16,400
coffee,

439
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:19,920
and fried rice?

440
00:18:22,464 --> 00:18:23,584
(Jiali)

441
00:18:26,079 --> 00:18:27,039
A false alarm

442
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:28,359
is the most beautiful word

443
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:30,000
in the world.

444
00:18:30,599 --> 00:18:31,480
Let's go, Zi.

445
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,640
Grab a drink.

446
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:34,680
Booked. See you at the usual place.

447
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:35,640
Okay.

448
00:18:46,079 --> 00:18:46,759
Thanks.

449
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:47,839
You ordered alcohol?

450
00:18:48,359 --> 00:18:49,160
Aren't you trying

451
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,039
for a baby?

452
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,839
But I ordered so many snacks.

453
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:52,839
If we can't finish them,

454
00:18:52,839 --> 00:18:53,880
it'll be a waste.

455
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:54,799
Thanks.

456
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:56,799
Wasting food is a sin.

457
00:18:57,319 --> 00:18:59,279
You told your fans

458
00:18:59,359 --> 00:19:00,319
you've been sticking to

459
00:19:00,319 --> 00:19:00,960
the 16:8 diet.

460
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,400
Exactly.

461
00:19:01,839 --> 00:19:03,160
Sixteen hours of eating,

462
00:19:03,160 --> 00:19:04,160
eight hours of fasting.

463
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:05,680
Isn't that the 16:8 diet?

464
00:19:06,079 --> 00:19:07,160
Come on, cheers.

465
00:19:07,559 --> 00:19:08,279
Fine.

466
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:20,079
Your husband is indeed having a meeting.

467
00:19:20,359 --> 00:19:21,359
But there are questions

468
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,519
unresolved.

469
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:24,000
Who exactly slipped the photos

470
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,000
into the flowers?

471
00:19:25,119 --> 00:19:26,200
What's the aim?

472
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,119
And he just got

473
00:19:28,119 --> 00:19:29,319
a new tennis membership card.

474
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,039
Why did he say

475
00:19:30,039 --> 00:19:31,240
he's been playing for months?

476
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,400
I think

477
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,920
it's just a misunderstanding.

478
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,200
Think about it.

479
00:19:36,839 --> 00:19:37,920
He loves me so much.

480
00:19:38,359 --> 00:19:39,400
How could he lie to me?

481
00:19:40,559 --> 00:19:43,119
What a classic trophy wife quote.

482
00:19:44,519 --> 00:19:45,160
Besides,

483
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:47,119
he's had Zhang Tao investigate,

484
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:49,359
but no lead yet.

485
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:50,960
We don't know

486
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,039
where the problem lies.

487
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:56,480
As for the membership card...

488
00:19:58,079 --> 00:19:59,480
I've realized now

489
00:20:00,039 --> 00:20:01,559
trying to wake up a trophy wife

490
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:03,640
is like convincing a man to give up

491
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,599
having children.

492
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:06,319
But Zi,

493
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,440
why do I feel

494
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,920
so uneasy?

495
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:12,359
Don't be uneasy.

496
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:16,000
Maybe we're overthinking.

497
00:20:16,519 --> 00:20:17,559
After all, Di Liren

498
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:18,880
passed through your family's

499
00:20:18,960 --> 00:20:19,960
(Good product share, Lucky Beauty Yu)
all sorts of tests

500
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,680
to marry you.

501
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:23,319
(Honey says I'm younger year after year)
And his current career

502
00:20:23,359 --> 00:20:25,759
is built entirely on
your dad's foundation.

503
00:20:26,319 --> 00:20:27,519
He wouldn't dare act rashly.

504
00:20:27,720 --> 00:20:28,640
Definitely.

505
00:20:29,359 --> 00:20:29,839
Exactly.

506
00:20:31,759 --> 00:20:32,720
You're right.

507
00:20:33,119 --> 00:20:34,160
If you question him again,

508
00:20:34,359 --> 00:20:35,920
you're questioning me.

509
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,799
Right?

510
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,480
Right.

511
00:20:38,519 --> 00:20:39,680
(Miss Yu, there are rumors about Mr. Di)
I don't trust men,

512
00:20:40,039 --> 00:20:41,200
(If you want to know, DM me)
but I trust you.

513
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:41,696
(What? Don't tell me it's that thing)

514
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,640
Even though I misunderstood him today,

515
00:20:43,839 --> 00:20:45,440
he has to apologize to me.

516
00:20:46,480 --> 00:20:47,079
How about this?

517
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:48,839
I'll give him a chance.

518
00:20:49,279 --> 00:20:50,880
Let him come pick me up,

519
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,039
giving him an out.

520
00:20:58,080 --> 00:21:01,248
(Happy)

521
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,400
(Liu Bai)
It's my brother.

522
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,680
I'll take it.

523
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:05,519
Okay.

524
00:21:06,559 --> 00:21:07,519
Everybody,

525
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,920
all eyes on me!

526
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,480
Look over here!

527
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:13,160
Miss Yu, thank you

528
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:15,839
for ordering a bottle of Black Ace!

529
00:21:16,832 --> 00:21:18,848
(Classy)

530
00:21:34,304 --> 00:21:35,776
(Honey)

531
00:21:37,440 --> 00:21:39,000
Why hasn't he asked me

532
00:21:39,079 --> 00:21:40,640
what I'm doing at the bar?

533
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:43,640
Can't you see my post?

534
00:22:28,640 --> 00:22:30,592
(Credit card charge: 3,000 yuan
Transaction completed)

535
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:35,400
Why isn't anyone coming to pick me up?

536
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:46,799
Miss Yu.

537
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,839
Can we talk a bit?

538
00:22:55,799 --> 00:22:59,200
Honey, you finally came to get me.

539
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:00,680
Let's go.

540
00:23:03,759 --> 00:23:04,559
You've had too much.

541
00:23:04,920 --> 00:23:06,200
I'll sober you up.

542
00:23:06,839 --> 00:23:07,359
Come on.

543
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,960
Where are we going?

544
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,079
Watch the steps.

545
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:11,839
Zi.

546
00:23:12,079 --> 00:23:13,720
- I compared the workout data
- Hello?

547
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:14,880
on Di Liren's phone and watch.

548
00:23:14,880 --> 00:23:16,000
What do you mean?

549
00:23:16,559 --> 00:23:17,200
Something's off.

550
00:23:17,839 --> 00:23:18,880
Some data don't match.

551
00:23:19,079 --> 00:23:19,759
It could be

552
00:23:19,759 --> 00:23:20,759
a network signal issue.

553
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,599
But either way,

554
00:23:22,839 --> 00:23:24,319
none of the data has anything

555
00:23:24,359 --> 00:23:25,200
to do with Weng Yue.

556
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,880
You talk to Meng

557
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:28,200
directly.

558
00:23:37,559 --> 00:23:39,480
I feel so dizzy.

559
00:23:42,839 --> 00:23:43,680
Where am I?

560
00:23:45,559 --> 00:23:47,160
I want to puke.

561
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,319
Where am I?

562
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:54,119
Where's Zi?

563
00:23:55,079 --> 00:23:55,960
Where's my phone?

564
00:23:56,519 --> 00:23:58,400
I need to call her.

565
00:24:00,039 --> 00:24:01,240
I need to make a call.

566
00:24:03,839 --> 00:24:05,559
Give me my phone back.

567
00:24:06,359 --> 00:24:07,000
Come on.

568
00:24:07,039 --> 00:24:08,000
I'm going to puke.

569
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:09,720
I feel bad.

570
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,440
Just take a rest.

571
00:24:10,440 --> 00:24:11,160
Okay?

572
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:11,799
Rest a bit.

573
00:24:12,759 --> 00:24:13,480
