624
00:26:29,240 --> 00:26:30,799
That's because...

625
00:26:32,720 --> 00:26:33,759
Because...

626
00:26:34,960 --> 00:26:35,480
Because...

627
00:26:36,440 --> 00:26:37,160
Don't you wonder

628
