732
00:30:31,360 --> 00:30:33,319
(I'm Jiao Xu.)

733
00:30:33,319 --> 00:30:34,400
Call me for your divorce.

734
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,319
By the way,

735
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:36,880
